{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063758/block/singleImage/3267103/wm/01M7BY462FCMKW6S7R2E45J6RQ.jpeg?updatedAt=1794623363\"/><figcaption>天文台預測今日氣溫介乎23至27度(林俊源攝)</figcaption></figure><p>天文台預測今日氣溫介乎23至27度，大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。 隨著高空擾動逐漸遠離廣東，今日日間天色好轉。展望明日大致天晴，隨後一兩日雲量較多及有一兩陣雨，星期一風勢較大。預料一道冷鋒會在下星期三橫過廣東沿岸，該區北風增強。受隨後的東北季候風影響，下周中後期廣東氣溫顯著下降。本港下周四、五預測最低氣溫降至18度。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T03:38:52.908306+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T02:29:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:53:07.019390+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T03:32:09.134772+00:00","content_hash":"d1b2d58e89ec0ab36fa6654c05e1c8184a5c1b66c178d8153f9aa0be67d0b28b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}